        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "Recognize Ollama WorkOS session cookies",
        "body": "## Summary\n- recognize the WorkOS AuthKit default `wos-session` cookie\n- preserve legacy Ollama and NextAuth cookie support\n- cover both manual headers and imported browser-cookie selection\n\n## Live proof\nRedacted live Ollama response on 2026-07-06:\n\n```text\nGET https://ollama.com/signin\nHTTP/2 303\nlocation: https://api.workos.com/user_management/authorize?client_id=<redacted>&...\n```\n\nOllama now routes sign-in through WorkOS AuthKit. The official AuthKit implementation defaults its session cookie to `wos-session`: https://github.com/workos/authkit-nextjs/blob/main/src/session.ts\n\nNo session value, browser cookie, or Keychain access was read.\n\n## Tests\n- `swift test --disable-sandbox --filter OllamaUsageFetcherTests` (20 passed)\n- changed Swift files pass SwiftFormat and SwiftLint strict\n- `git diff --check upstream/main...HEAD`\n\n## Commits\n- exactly 3: implementation, tests, documentation",
